Darbar Me Sajjad Pe Mushkil Yeh Padi Hai<br>
har Simt Tamashayi Hai Aur Binte Ali Hai<br>
<br>
1. Gardan Me Rasan Bandh Gayi Aur Jal Gaya Kurta<br>
is Tarha Sakina Ko Mila Baap Ka Pursa<br>
shiddat Ki Kadi Dhoop Me Nazou'n Ki Pali Hai<br>
<br>
2. Be Parda Rasan Basta Jo 0ontou'n Pe Haram Hai<br>
zanjeerou'n Me Jakde Huve Abid Ke Qadam Hai<br>
manzar Yeh Mashiyyat Ki Nazar Dekh Rahi Hai<br>
<br>
3. Namoos Ki Tash-heer Pe Jaa'n Khote Hain Abid<br>
yasrab Ki Taraf Dekh Ke Khoo'n Rote Hain Abid<br>
kehta Hai Koi Jab Ke Yehi Aale Nabi Hai<br>
<br>
4. Abid Ko Sar-e-raah Satate Hain Sitamgar<br>
rukta Hai Jo Beemaar Toh Barsate Hain Pathar<br>
hai Raasta Dushwar Toh Manzil Bhi Kadi Hai<br>
<br>
5. Hain Sham-e-ghareeba'n Ke Abhi Zakhm Badan Par<br>
kehti Hai Sakina Ke Nazar Kijay Behen Par<br>
abid Ke Magar Hathou'n Me Zanjeer Padi Hai<br>
<br>
<br>
6. Ghazi Ko Sada Deta Hai Beemaar Har Ek Gaam<br>
zainab Ka Jo Darbaar Me Leta Hai Koi Naam<br>
sajjad Pe Allah Bohat Sakht Ghadi Hai<br>
<br>
7. Sar Naize Se Shabbir Ka Deta Hai Duhayi<br>
ya Shah-e-najaf Aaiye Imdaad Ko Jaldi<br>
bete Pe Mere Dekhiye Uftaad Padi Hai<br>
<br>
8. Darbar-e-sitamgar Me Qayamat Huvi Barpa<br>
tha Takht Pe Baitha Woh Layee'n Kaanp Raha Tha<br>
sajjad Ne Darbar Me Angdayi Jo Li Hai<br>
<br>
9. Baba Ki Wasiyat Pe Amal Karna Tha Usko<br>
darbaar Ulat Dena Tha Mushkil Nahi Jisko<br>
sajjad Ke Hontou'n Pe Saji Naad-e-ali Hai<br>
<br>
10. Sar Neeche Hai Sarwar Ka Toh Kursi Pe Sitamgar<br>
zainab Ki Nigahou'n Me Qayamat Ka Tha Manzar<br>
majboor Behen Bhai Ka Sar Dekh Rahi Hal<br>
<br>
11. Likh Paaye Na Hyder Dil-e-sajjad Ka Alam<br>
darbaar Me Karte Hain Bandhe Hathou'n Se Matam<br>
lab Hai Shah-e-mazloom Ka Zalim Ki Chadi Hai